{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/WakeUp.png?t=1746564647\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One ordinary November night, a sixteen-year-old boy called Jamie witnesses a paranormal event in his own house. Shortly afterwards, he is transported to Aliorbis, a mysterious alternate version of Earth where magic and science coexist in almost perfect harmony. It\u2019s the place where all the legends that we know of were born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There, Jamie learns that he is what is known as a \u201cVisitor\u201d, someone who can cross the barrier that separates his world and Aliorbis. He quickly becomes part of SEEK, an organization that investigates crimes that pose a threat to both worlds. Through his adventures with SEEK, Jamie slowly becomes acquainted with its dark and twisted past filled with corruption and chaos, and gradually begins to wonder if he is truly on the right side of this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a plot that mixes elements of fantasy and thriller, play as different characters with unique storylines and points of views and investigate multiple scenarios filled with clues and details in this mystery game inspired by videogames of the late 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/Welcome!.gif?t=1746564647\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3322730?t=1746564647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/e4699db113f48c0ea7bf403e8026fb508c43ba08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746564647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/f3db4b977e46c200b7d40e9e5f9db784109c44c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746564647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_